# =====================================================================
# Replication repository for "Stay, React, or Conform? Examining Social
# Influence Effects on Aesthetic Judgments" (Lizardo & Skiles).
# Tracked: analysis pipeline (R/), renv lockfile, generated tables and
# figures (tables/*.tex, figures/*.pdf), README. Everything else is local.
# =====================================================================

